                    'spotify\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\nmy genius highlights\n\n\n\n\ntate talk #11: song bios\n\n\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2024\n#8 soty: “like him” by tyler, the creator | #20 soty: “girl, so confusing featuring lorde” by charli xcx & lorde\n\n\n\nbest of 2024, so far\n#3 soty: “the girl, so confusing version with lorde” by charli xcx & lorde\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2023\n#10 soty: “vampire” by olivia rodrigo | #14 soty: “boy’s a liar, pt. 2” by pinkpantheress & ice spice | #4 aoty: did you know there’s a tunnel under ocean blvd by lana del rey | #11 aoty: heaven knows by pinkpantheress\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2022\n#5 soty: “bad habit” by steve lacy | #3 aoty: renaissance by beyoncé\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2021\n#7 soty: “family ties” by baby keem & kendrick lamar  | #10 aoty: happier than ever by billie eilish\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2020\n#3 aoty: folklore by taylor swift\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2019\n#18 soty: “juice” by lizzo |\n#7 aoty: thank u, next by ariana grande | #13 aoty: father of the bride by vampire weekend\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2018\n#2 soty: “sicko mode” by travis scott |\n#15 aoty: 7 by beach house\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2017\n#10 soty: “green light” by lorde | #25 soty: “havana” by camila cabello | #6 aoty: melodrama by lorde | #50 aoty: funk wav bounces vol 1 by calvin harris\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2016\n#6 soty: “frankie sinatra” by the avalanches | #35 soty: “hold up” by beyoncé | #36 soty: “starboy” by the weeknd ft. daft punk | #23 aoty: i had a dream that you were mine by hamilton leithauser & rostam | #36 aoty: skin by flume\n\n\ngenius awards 2016\n5th best moderator | 5th best interview (ft. serein)\n\n\n\n\n\n\ngenius awards 2015 \n4th best avatar | 7th best editor | 10th best transcriber | 10th best web annotator\n\n\n\n\nyear-end list 2015\n#14 soty: "pedestrian at best" by courtney barnett | #16 soty: "where are ü now" by jack ü ft. justin bieber | ghostwrote parts of #30 soty: "what do you mean" by justin bieber | #11 aoty: sometimes i sit and think, and sometimes i just sit by courtney barnett\n\n\n\n\n\n\nmy genius history:\n\n\n\nFebruary 2015: edded by peter nowogrodzki, aka XenaWarriorPrincess\nDecember 6, 2015: Drew_Harvie becomes editor\nDecember 19, 2015: 50k IQ!\nJanuary 12, 2016: my meta tates confirmed better than verified tates by diplo, tinashe, skrillex, and pusha t\nApril 1, 2016: went to hq\nMay 24, 2016: cocochase becomes editor!!!\nMay 27, 2016: i got modded by the amazing streetlights.\nJune 15, 2016: the god mod Freeus upvotes me to 100k\nNovember 2017: i came out of hiding to work on year-end list and became the #1 scholar on “All I Want For Christmas Is You!!”\nFebruary 19, 2018: vinylzombie_mcr upvoted me to 150k!\nOctober 29, 2019: completely revamped “Rivers and Roads” instead of studying for midterms; first real song page resuscitation for me in a while\nDecember 3, 2019: got assigned 3 blurbs for the year-end list, making my fifth straight year contributing to it!\nDecember 14, 2020: still here :) sixth year of contributing to year-end list, this time with folklore!\nDecember 2021: year 7 baby\nDecember 17, 2022: 8th year of year-end! started here in middle school and am now graduating college, super surreal to still be around.\nDecember 2023: 999\nSummer 2024: at some point, i hit 200k IQ, likely due to my work on some of the kendrick v canada diss tracks. super cool, and only took 6 years since my last 50k milestone!!',
